---
// src/pages/en/privacidad.astro
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeaderLegal from '../../components/HeaderLegal.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Brickell Lab"
  description="Brickell Lab privacy policy in accordance with Law 25.326 on the Protection of Personal Data of the Argentine Republic."
  canonical="https://labbrickell.com.ar/en/privacidad"
>
  <HeaderLegal lang="en" />

  <main class="lg">
    <div class="lg-in">
      <span class="lg-eyebrow">Brickell Lab · Legal</span>
      <h1 class="lg-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lg-date">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="lg-body">
        <p>
          At Brickell Lab (hereinafter "we", "our" or "the Studio"), with a digital address at
          labbrickell.com.ar, we are committed to protecting the privacy of those who visit our
          website and communicate with us. This Privacy Policy describes what information we collect,
          how we use it, and the rights you are entitled to under Law 25.326 on the Protection of
          Personal Data of the Argentine Republic.
        </p>
        <p>
          Brickell Lab is the parent brand of an ecosystem that includes <strong>Lúmina</strong>
          (event management platform) and <strong>Lexa</strong> (translation service). This policy
          covers the labbrickell.com.ar website, including the Lexa section. Lúmina, operating on its
          own subdomain with login, has its own privacy policy available within that platform.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          Brickell Lab is responsible for the processing of personal data collected through this
          website. You can contact us at any time by writing to info@labbrickell.com.ar.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
        <p>We only collect the data you actively provide when you communicate with us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>First and last name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Phone number (when you contact us via WhatsApp)</li>
          <li>Information about your project, inquiry, or the documents you need translated</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This site has no registration forms: contact is made directly via WhatsApp or email. In
          addition, if you give your consent through our cookie banner, we may automatically collect
          technical browsing data through Google Analytics, such as anonymized IP address, device
          type, browser, pages visited, and session time.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Handling of documents for translation (Lexa)</h2>
        <p>
          When you hire Lexa's translation service, you may share personal, legal, medical, academic,
          or official documents with us. These documents are used exclusively to perform the
          requested translation, are treated confidentially, and are not shared with third parties
          outside the service. Once the work is completed and its purpose fulfilled, the documents are
          kept only for a reasonable time to address any revisions or claims, and are then securely
          deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Purpose of processing</h2>
        <p>The personal data you provide is used exclusively to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiry or quote request</li>
          <li>Manage the business relationship and the provision of services</li>
          <li>Carry out the requested translation work (in the case of Lexa)</li>
          <li>Improve the browsing experience on our site (analytics data, with your consent)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use your data to send unsolicited advertising, nor do we share it with third parties for commercial purposes.</p>

        <h2>5. Legal bases for processing</h2>
        <p>
          The processing of your data is based on your explicit consent when you communicate with us
          and accept the analytics cookies, and on Brickell Lab's legitimate interest in managing
          inquiries and business relationships.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Sharing data with third parties</h2>
        <p>We may share your data with the following third parties only to the extent necessary to provide the service:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google LLC</strong> — through Google Analytics and Google Search Console, for web traffic analysis. Google may process data outside Argentina in accordance with its own privacy policies.</li>
          <li><strong>Meta Platforms (WhatsApp)</strong> — when you start a conversation through our WhatsApp link, WhatsApp's terms and conditions apply.</li>
          <li><strong>Hostinger</strong> — web hosting and email provider where the site's data and email communications are stored.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or transfer your personal data to third parties.</p>

        <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses technical cookies necessary for its proper functioning and Google Analytics
          analytics cookies. Upon entering, we show you a banner where you can accept or reject the
          analytics cookies: Google Analytics is only activated if you give your consent. You can
          change your choice at any time from the cookie settings link in the site footer, or by
          configuring your browser to reject or delete cookies. Disabling the analytics cookies does
          not affect the functionality of the site.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
        <p>In accordance with Law 25.326 and its implementing regulations, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> — know what data of yours we have on record</li>
          <li><strong>Rectification</strong> — correct inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion</strong> — request the deletion of your data</li>
          <li><strong>Objection</strong> — object to the processing of your data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, write to us at info@labbrickell.com.ar with the subject
          "ARSO Rights". We will respond within 5 business days.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you believe your rights have not been properly addressed, you can file a claim with the
          Agency for Access to Public Information (AAIP), the supervisory authority in Argentina:
          www.argentina.gob.ar/aaip.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data against
          unauthorized access, loss, or improper disclosure. However, no system for transmitting data
          over the internet is completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain your personal data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it
          was collected or while the business relationship continues. Once the purpose is fulfilled,
          the data will be deleted or anonymized.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy at any time. Any significant change will be communicated
          by updating the date at the beginning of this document. We recommend reviewing it
          periodically.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions related to this policy, write to us at info@labbrickell.com.ar or send us
          a message on WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Base>

<style>
  .lg{ background:var(--surface); color:var(--text-primary); padding-top:clamp(90px,12vh,130px); }
  .lg-in{ width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 var(--gutter) clamp(56px,7vw,88px); }
  .lg-eyebrow{
    display:inline-block; margin-bottom:14px;
    font-size:11px; font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--magenta);
  }
  .lg-title{ margin:0; font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,52px); font-weight:var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing:-.04em; line-height:1.05; color:var(--text-primary); }
  .lg-date{ margin:14px 0 0; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); }
  .lg-body{ margin-top:clamp(36px,4vw,48px); }
  .lg-body h2{ margin:clamp(32px,3.4vw,44px) 0 12px; font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px); font-weight:var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--text-primary); }
  .lg-body p{ margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--text-secondary); }
  .lg-body ul{ margin:0 0 16px; padding-left:22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .lg-body li{ font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-secondary); }
  .lg-body strong{ color:var(--text-primary); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); }
</style>